cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite it using these metadata. Code is MIT-licensed; text, protocols,
  coding sheets and aggregate results are CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE and LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0).
title: "ICML 2026 agent reproduction challenge: reproductions and verdict audit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kondrateva
    given-names: Ekaterina
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3623-6106"
    affiliation: Maastricht University
    alias: kondratevakate
repository-code: "https://github.com/kondratevakate/icml-2026-repro"
abstract: >-
  Reproductions of ICML 2026 papers submitted to the ICML 2026 agent reproduction challenge, and a
  meta-research audit of the challenge's public verdicts (how verdicts were aggregated, and why medical and
  life-science papers were rarely decided), with frozen protocols, analysis code, coding sheets and results.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - meta-research
  - machine learning
  - crowd reproduction
  - medical machine learning
  - ICML 2026
